  "body": "Looks like CPU use on synchrotrons went up significantly on May 1st (Saturday):\r\n\r\n![Screen Shot 2021-05-04 at 23 15 27](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/24193/117076689-b6afaf80-ad2e-11eb-9161-5cb725edd3eb.png)\r\n\r\nDid we deploy anything on Friday? Are there other events we can correlate with this?\r\n\r\nWe deployed fe604a022a7142157da7e90a40330beb2a11af7a on the evening of Thursday, April 27th\r\n\r\n@anoadragon453 Do you know what was deployed prior to that? Have there been any deploys since?",
